 ```
 
 Run `npm run generate:platform` before the release gate when canonical pack, benchmark, or release data changes.
+
+## GitHub release gates
+
+- **Release gate** installs with `npm ci`, regenerates artifacts, rejects drift, validates release metadata, typechecks, lints, builds the production Worker, runs every Node test, exercises the Core harness, rebuilds the source archive, and uploads logs.
+- **Browser quality** runs representative desktop Chromium and phone WebKit interactions.
+- **Source freshness** performs a scheduled point-in-time check of external source endpoints and opens a review issue without treating one transient outage as a release failure.
+
+After the workflows are merged, maintainers must require the release and browser checks in `main` branch protection. See `docs/maintainers/repository-settings.md`.
